  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "A line with slope 0 has equation \\(y=b\\). If \\(b=0\\), it coincides with the \\(x\\)-axis; otherwise it is parallel to the \\(x\\)-axis. Thus C is correct.",
